{"siren:A café survey found that most respondents wanted reusable cups. Only customers who used the café app saw the survey. Staff reported that washing space was limited at busy times. The owner wants to replace all disposable cups next week.":"1b0319d52875fda1347d5456d6cf1cd306e939ec12aadc913a5ac8629159d4eb","lauren:How would you explain a decision to revise the trial rather than abandon it?":"46b32557ce28014ea2a42da26f3aeadec2668f4ec7a2f4cedf15af6e9ed707a9","siren:The panel called the proposal audacious, though not always in the ways its authors intended. One reviewer praised its refusal of easy answers; another wondered whether unresolved contradictions were being recast as intellectual courage. Both welcomed the questions it raised, but only the first treated that achievement as sufficient grounds for the award.":"87dbc11349c314e9625c4aed916305821e4832da0dd2cddb54f39b487fa7e112","lauren:I'm sorry, I didn't mean to bother you.":"afb81b52a47372dd32a7ca2f66fb3053fb8a8ae5741191cc0a8c3218b4ff3e54","lauren:She has a green thumb.":"ff76b1c4c154c5d24836b39614f374ad105d1d3fabd25cec645aa140423a22c7"}